Most people know enough English already. What they don't know is how to continue a conversation. Those that are able to continue a small-talk conversation don't know how to build relationships.

This theme collects works which guide you to go beyond workplace English and small-talk so that you can finally feel like you belong in an English speaking community. More than this it will guide you to "win friends and influence people" following ConversationOS  principles. It is the second language implementation after MandarinOS.

It probably will amaze English learners to find out they don't have to spend months learning more and more vocabulary. Mastering 5-6 basic conversations becomes the foundation to leapfrog past all the other learning techniques. Progress will be made in weeks rather than months and years. Read on and learn!
